INSERT_UPDATE Category; code[unique = true]      ; categoryUrl                                ; $catalogVersion; retailName               ; $picture              ; description[lang = en]
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_05  ; /catalog/category/bone-health-support      ;                ; Bone                     ; bonehealth-icon       ; Bone density can be affected by several factors, including aging, lifestyle, hormones, diet, and genetics. These products provide an array of options and nutrient levels to meet varying bone health needs at different stages of life.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_16  ; /catalog/category/male-health              ;                ; Men's Health             ; male-icon             ; Men have distinctive needs, particularly during midlife when certain organs and systems may require focused attention. These products offer natural ways to support energy production, support prostate health, and promote vitality.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_11  ; /catalog/category/female-health            ;                ; Women's Health           ; female-icon           ; Women experience different nutritional needs during their various life stages. To optimize health from menarche to menopause and onward, the specialized products in this category are designed to uniquely support complex female biochemistry.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_15  ; /catalog/category/liver-support            ;                ; Liver Support            ; liver-icon            ; The liver performs vital functions, including filtering blood, detoxifying harmful substances, breaking down hormones, and producing cholesterol and bile. Products in this category help protect liver tissue and support its healthy function.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_22  ; /catalog/category/thyroid-support          ;                ; Thyroid                  ; thyroid-icon          ; The thyroid is a small gland with big roles, including concentrating iodine and producing thyroid hormones, which can impact overall health. These products support thyroid tissue health and/or thyroid hormone physiological pathways.*
					  ; 1                        ; /1                                         ;                ;                          ;                       ;
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_08  ; /catalog/category/cytokine-balance-support ;                ; Cytokine Balance Support ; cytokine-icon         ; Cytokines are the body’s chemical messengers and are integral to a healthy immune system. Unresolved or imbalanced cytokine activity can result in unhealthy immune function. These nutritional products are formulated to promote cytokine balance.*
					  ; catalog                  ; /catalog                                   ;                ;                          ; FullCatalog-icon      ; Shop our carefully curated catalog that includes exclusive XYMOGEN formulas and the top 100 practitioner-trusted supplement brands. Our full selection of dietary supplements offers wellness support for every stage of life. Conveniently shop by health category, brand, or product name to find what you need for every step of your wellness journey.
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_12  ; /catalog/category/gastrointestinal-support ;                ; Gut Health               ; gastrointestinal-icon ; An optimally functioning gastrointestinal system is a cornerstone of good health. The products in this category have roles in supporting digestive function and comfort, gut tissue integrity, and a healthy gut environment.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_09  ; /catalog/category/detoxification           ;                ; Detox                    ; detoxification-icon   ; When environmental toxins accumulate in the body, the effects can be wide-ranging. These nutritional products support detoxification organs and systems to help the body naturally rid itself of reactive molecules and harmful substances.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_07  ; /catalog/category/cell-life-regulation     ;                ; Cellular Wellness        ; celllife-icon         ; Keeping cells healthy is a core aspect of wellness. From guarding cell membrane integrity to promoting a healthy cell life cycle, these products target the most basic aspects of a healthy body—cell structure and function.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_01  ; /catalog/category/adrenal-support          ;                ; Adrenal                  ; adrenal-icon          ; Modern stress is difficult to manage, leaving mental/physical exhaustion and susceptibility to infection and disease in its wake. These specialized products help the body naturally balance stress physiology and promote healthy adrenal function.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_20  ; /catalog/category/relaxation-sleep         ;                ; Stress & Sleep           ; relaxation-icon       ; Proper sleep and stress management are critical to healthy brain and immune function and maintaining robust health. Products in this category offer support for the physiological response to stress and/or promote relaxation for restful sleep.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_06  ; /catalog/category/cardiovascular-support   ;                ; Cardiovascular           ; cardiovascular-icon   ; Many nutrients can offer benefits to the cardiovascular system. The products in this category address the various physiological pathways and mechanisms that influence cardiovascular health.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_02  ; /catalog/category/antioxidant-activity     ;                ; Antioxidant              ; antioxidant-icon      ; The healthy metabolism of glucose and sensitivity to endogenous insulin are key factors for metabolic wellness. Micronutrients and botanical compounds, as found in these specialized products, support the glucose/insulin physiological pathways.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_24  ; /catalog/category/nsf-certified-for-sport  ;                ; NSF Certified for Sport  ; nsfsport-icon-h       ;
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_14  ; /catalog/category/joint-muscle-support     ;                ; Joints & Muscles         ; jointmuscle-icon      ; Healthy joints and muscles are critical to moving freely, exercising comfortably, and avoiding injuries. These products help nourish muscles and connective tissues to promote comfort, flexibility, and mobility.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_04  ; /catalog/category/body-composition         ;                ; Body Composition         ; bodycomposition-icon  ; Body composition aids can make a real difference in the success of a dietary or fitness program. These products can help by providing more fiber or additional protein or by supporting a healthy metabolism.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_21  ; /catalog/category/sports-nutrition         ;                ; Fitness                  ; sports-icon           ; Athletes and health-minded individuals alike seek to maximize their fitness potential. Products in this category support optimal body composition, cellular energy production, and the body’s tissue-repairing mechanisms.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_10  ; /catalog/category/essential-fatty-acids    ;                ; Essential Fatty Acids    ; essentialoils-icon    ; The health effects of omega-3 fatty acids are well-known and range from neurological to cardiovascular support. These specialized products offer some of the highest quality omega-3 oils on the market in various advanced dosage forms.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_19  ; /catalog/category/probiotics               ;                ; Probiotic                ; probiotics-icon       ; From metabolism to immune system regulation to the gut–brain axis, our understanding of the gut microbiota’s influence continues to expand. The probiotics in this category include some of the most potent, well-researched strains available.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_13  ; /catalog/category/immune-system-support    ;                ; Immune                   ; immune-icon           ; The immune system is the protector of good health. It is a complex system encompassing gut health, cytokine balance, immune cell activation, and more. The specialized products in this category support various aspects of a healthy immune system.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_104 ; /catalog/category/childrens-health         ;                ; Children’s Health        ; childrens-icon        ; Nutrition is an important part of healthy child development. Common clinical conditions that impact children can be linked to inadequate nutrient levels necessary to fuel development. These products can help support your child as they grow.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_18  ; /catalog/category/neurologic-cognitive     ;                ; Brain & Nervous System   ; neurologic-icon       ; Good nutrition, a healthy lifestyle, and natural nootropics can all influence brain and neurological health. Products in this category optimize the structure and function of neurologic tissue and support healthy cognition.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_03  ; /catalog/category/blood-sugar-support      ;                ; Blood Sugar              ; bloodsugar-icon       ; The healthy metabolism of glucose and sensitivity to endogenous insulin are key factors for metabolic wellness. Micronutrients and botanical compounds, as found in these specialized products, support the glucose/insulin physiological pathways.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_17  ; /catalog/category/multivitamins-minerals   ;                ; Multivitamins            ; multivitamin-icon     ; Foundational wellness is key to vitality and longevity. The products in this category offer various compositions, including science-backed ingredients in their bioavailable forms that provide wellness support to look and feel great at every age.*
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_26  ; /catalog/category/vitamins-minerals        ;                ; Vitamins & Minerals      ; multivitamin-icon     ;
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_27  ; /catalog/category/multivitamins            ;                ; Multivitamins            ; multivitamin-icon     ;
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_30  ; /catalog/category/hormone-support          ;                ; Hormone Support          ;                       ;
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_31  ; /catalog/category/mood                     ;                ; Mood                     ;                       ;
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_25  ; /catalog/category/proteins                 ;                ; Proteins                 ;                       ;
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_28  ; /catalog/category/energy                   ;                ; Energy                   ;                       ;
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_29  ; /catalog/category/stress-sleep             ;                ; Stress & Sleep           ; relaxation-icon       ;
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_33  ; /catalog/category/vision                   ;                ; Vision                   ;                       ;
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_32  ; /catalog/category/fish-oils                ;                ; Fish Oils                ;                       ;
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_34  ; /catalog/category/herbal-products          ;                ; Herbal Products          ;                       ;
					  ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_23  ; /catalog/category/miscellaneous            ;                ;                          ;                       ;


